    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p><em>Every family has its black sheep, every pantheon has its trickster.</em></p>\n<p><strong>Domain:&nbsp;</strong>Once per battle as a quick action when you are engaged with an enemy, roll a d20 that we&rsquo;ll refer to as your <em>trick die</em>.</p>\n<p>As a free action before the start of your next turn, give your trick die to a nearby ally or enemy who is about to make an attack roll. The trick die result becomes the natural result of their roll instead.</p>\n<p><strong>Domain Spells:&nbsp;</strong>Wink of the Trickster, Taunt and Tease, Trickster&rsquo;s Guise, Borrowed Trick</p>"
    },
